1154	/// scope rationale `AuthCubit`'s own doc gives). [toggleBiometric] is the
1155	/// I/O matrix's optimistic flip/revert, end to end: the repository itself
1156	/// flips [AccountSettingsRepository.currentBiometricEnabled] immediately
1157	/// and emits it on [AccountSettingsRepository.biometricEnabledStream] —
1158	/// this cubit only mirrors that stream into its own [AccountSettingsState]
